            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Dang Xua",
            "review_text": "Jacob G\nCollege Station, Texas112 contributions\n0\nThe Skinny!\nSep 2018 • Couples\n#1 this place is historic. It is an old house and grounds and gardens of nobility... and it's so on the down-low that it's ridiculous. That alone is worth the visit. \n\n#2 they have a cool old motorbike collection. I shared some photos of a few.\n\n#3 Everything I ate was tasty! And the service was good, and the pricing was good.\n\nI do suggest the coconut smoothie, or the strawberry and orange juice.\n\nBetween the history and the food and the plants and fountains and the atmosphere, you're sure to enjoy! Definitely a great romantic spot for breakfast!\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2018",
